14
00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:29.460
Honestly man, aren't you worried about the fated mate thing?

15
00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:33.460
The oracle said whoever finds their fated mate will rule all shifter clans.

16
00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.460
Speaking of which, my wolf has been restless lately.

17
00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:42.730
That means... she's close.

18
00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:44.730
I don't care what the oracle says.

19
00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:49.730
My family has ruled over shifters for centuries.

20
00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:55.730
The title, the throne, the fated mate, they're all mine.

21
00:01:55.730 --> 00:01:57.730
That was never up for debate.
